      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t seem to be implemented correctly, or at least, it doesn\u0027t achieve what the commit message states it should. Could you please provide some context in the commit message of how/why this is going to be used?\n\nMore specifically, do you plan on using this on unmanaged domains, or is the plan to use this with DMA domains? I\u0027m concerned about the latter since there are a few checks in the kernel that check for an MSI cookie and this would break those checks, since the cookie would be overwritten.",
      "revId": "6b9b94b279c108966397f9594e0a25c8fc94fc15",
