      "writtenOn": "2026-01-29T22:57:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "sorry, I think this should actually be:\n\n```\nbool force_set_fault_handler \u003d false;\n\nif (WARN_ON(!domain))\n        return;\n        \ntrace_android_vh_set_iommu_fault_handler(\u0026force_set_fault_handler, domain, handler, token);\nif (!force_set_fault_handler \u0026\u0026 WARN_ON(domain-\u003ecookie_type !\u003d IOMMU_COOKIE_NONE))\n        return;\n```",
      "parentUuid": "7ae85e52_d684aecc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2016,
