      "writtenOn": "2026-02-05T16:55:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The goal is to allow IOMMU fault handlers on DMA domains. The hook will set set_fh \u003d true and save the handler and token into the ANDROID_VENDOR_DATA_ARRAY fields. Then we skip the WARN_ON() check and prevent the cookie type from being changed e.g. keep IOMMU_COOKIE_DMA_IOVA, as currently IOMMU_COOKIE_DMA_IOVA and IOMMU_COOKIE_FAULT_HANDLER as mutually exclusive. The arm-smmu driver is also updated accordingly.",
      "parentUuid": "b1435d13_da8a2d40",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2016,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2019,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "6b9b94b279c108966397f9594e0a25c8fc94fc15",
